/T (On the ground of fraud, a policy of Life Insurance may be called in question at any time within 3 years from the date of issuance of the policy or the date of commencement of risk or the date of revival of the policy or the date of the rider to the policy, whichever is later. For this, the insurer shall have to communicate in writing to the insured or the legal representatives or nominees or assignees of the insured, as applicable, mentioning the ground and materials on which such decision is based.)
